It covers: the product and rating engine (how a premium is calculated), quotes, underwriting, policy issuance;. endorsements (mid-term changes), renewals, premium collection;.

11
00:00:49.210 --> 00:01:04.037
claims: first notice of loss, health cashless and reimbursement, motor surveys with photos, life claims, fraud detection, settlement;. reinsurance, actuarial reserving, finance and regulatory reporting;. the algorithms:

12
00:01:04.317 --> 00:01:21.106
GLM pricing, rules engines, underwriting scores, telematics, image-based damage assessment, fraud networks, claims triage, chain-ladder reserves, lapse prediction;. the data platform and tech stack, with India specifics (IRDAI, NHCX, Bima Sugam).

13
00:01:21.386 --> 00:01:22.367
Reading time:

14
00:01:22.647 --> 00:01:23.543
80 min.

15
