Insurance in India is regulated by IRDAI.

18
00:01:30.747 --> 00:01:41.819
Product approval, policyholder protection (free-look periods, claim timelines, grievance redressal), distribution rules, solvency and reporting requirements change over time.

19
00:01:42.099 --> 00:01:45.725
Every regulatory statement here is a summary marked VERIFY.

20
00:01:46.005 --> 00:01:50.848
